# Static hosting for the demo (Netlify format). The picker is the /demo page; every other path is the CRM's own app,
# which reads its address in the browser. Assets and recorded data are real files and are never rewritten.
/demo   /picker.html   200
/       /picker.html   200
# A page the visitor's browser asks the server for (the website preview's frame, a file download) has no server: a plain notice.
/api/*  /unavailable.html  404
/*      /app.html      200
